I had given a pair of Adidas original shoes for dry-cleaning which was supposed to be delivered on 2nd May of this month. When I visited the shop the shoe were ready; However when i examined their work, I noticed they have managed to remove the pasting of the both shoes. When I asked them to get it fixed they asked for 1 day. Next day when i visited they gave me some random excuse as they have not sent the shoes for repair.

I followed on multiple call for next 3 days to deliver but some other excuses was ready. Later on 6th May they said that the shoe is ready and delivered it to my house. I saw nothing was done, they damaged my experience sneakers and didn’t even bother to apologise.

@synchronicity @nahar beware when you give your belongings to these ppl. Sharing few pictures for everyone to see their great art work.
